{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">筲箕灣發生一單非禮案件。今日（15日）凌晨時分，一名女子在筲箕灣南安里報案，指遭一名陌生男子用繩索勒頸，並被觸碰胸口非禮。警方接報趕抵現場，當場拘捕一名29歲涉案男子，案件列作「非禮」跟進。據了解，有人從後雙臂環抱事主，並碰胸口非禮，雙方並不相識。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-09-15 上午10.24.18.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026gJRA4ravGo1789439700.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-09-15 上午10.24.18.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-09-15 上午10.26.20.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026iXgPRfz2Lv1789439693.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-09-15 上午10.26.20.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">網上流傳現場片段，上載影片的網民發文：「好彩沿路有路人幫手報警處理，女仔先冇事。」片段顯示，涉事男子身穿紅色球衣，女事主在現場驚魂未定哭道：「佢啱啱箍我頸呀！」男途人見狀隨即上前，將女事主拉到自己身邊保護，並向紅衣男喝斥：「你做咩事？」、「佢箍女仔頸，幫手報警。」警員接報後趕到現場，隨即向該名身穿紅色球衣的男子問話調查。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-15T03:00:33.324476+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":286,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}